<h2>How to register</h2>
{{ actionLink({ text: "Register with Handforth Online", href: "https://gp-registration.nhs.uk/N81070/gpregistration/landing" }) }}
<p>You can also ask reception for a registration form.</p>

<h2>Our practice area</h2>
<p>We only accept applications from within our practice area. Contact reception to check whether your address is within the boundary.</p>

<h2>After you register</h2>
<p>Once you are registered, you can <a href="{{ practice.nhs_app_link.url }}">set up the {{ practice.nhs_app_link.name }}</a> to order prescriptions and see your health record.</p>
